From: Ilya I. Nikitin <ilya.i.nikitin@proton.me>
Subject: [PATCH] msm8916-wcd: declare the earpiece mono

The earpiece mixer routes RX1 alone through RDAC2 to the single EAR
amplifier. Advertising stereo playback silently discards the right
channel. Declare one playback channel so audio servers downmix stereo
sources before sending them to the codec, as for the speaker.

---
--- a/ucm2/codecs/msm8916-wcd/Earpiece.conf
+++ b/ucm2/codecs/msm8916-wcd/Earpiece.conf
@@ -21,7 +21,7 @@
 
 	Value {
 		PlaybackPCM "${var:WcdPlaybackPCM}"
-		PlaybackChannels 2
+		PlaybackChannels 1
 		PlaybackPriority 100
 	}
 }
